# alongside the stock provider. It advertises a distinct protocol id (avoiding a
# duplicate-key clash in the ShapeId-keyed provider map) and a lower precision, so it is
# the protocol selected for this service's requests.
#
# Without this line the class is dead code and both modeled errors collapse into an
# untyped CallException at the client.
